  },
  "ingredients": [
    "2 tablespoon peanut butter",
    "2 tablespoon low-carb maple syrup",
    "2 large egg",
    "4 tablespoon heavy whipping cream",
    "4 tablespoon flaxseed meal",
    "1/2 teaspoon baking powder",
    "1 tablespoon butter"
  ],
  "instructions": [
    {
      "text": "Mix together the peanut butter, low-carb maple syrup, and eggs.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/peanut-butter-pancakes/#wprm-recipe-51025-step-0-0",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/04/IMG_9490.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Once the peanut butter is beginning to break up and incorporate, add in the heavy cream.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/peanut-butter-pancakes/#wprm-recipe-51025-step-0-1",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/04/IMG_94912.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine once more and then add the flaxseed and baking powder. Mix everything well to form a pancake batter.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/peanut-butter-pancakes/#wprm-recipe-51025-step-0-2",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/04/IMG_94981.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Grease a pan with a little bit of butter over medium-low heat. Once the pan is hot, pour in the pancake batter.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/peanut-butter-pancakes/#wprm-recipe-51025-step-0-3",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/04/IMG_9503.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cook the pancake until the sides are hardening up and the top is bubbling. If using a ring mold (which I highly recommend), remove it now. Use a spatula to flip the pancake over. Cook for an additional 1–2 minutes.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/peanut-butter-pancakes/#wprm-recipe-51025-step-0-4",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/04/IMG_95061.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Continue with the remaining batter. Serve and enjoy!",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/peanut-butter-pancakes/#wprm-recipe-51025-step-0-5",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/04/PBPancakesLarge.jpg"
    }
  ],
